    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2?thread=cmsg_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2FVLrqu7REJ6EYUbr4JythQ)_\n\n## What\n\n- The \"Being developed\" section of `emacs-modular/.config/emacs-modular/CHANGELOG.org` had one long paragraph per feature.\n- Each feature is now a `**` sub-heading with short lines:\n  - `Merged:` the pull requests.\n  - `Not tested:` what was merged but never tried, on its own line.\n  - `Open:` and `To do:` for what is left.\n  - Long accounts (keybindings, SVG chips) are bullet lists.\n- Nothing was dropped: every pull request and caveat of the old text is still there.\n- The date line is 2026-11-12 and the intro says what the headings hold.\n\n## Not checked\n\n- Only the changelog changed; nothing was run.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiD1EqErxv8Y1wG33ZF)_",
